    "fetchedAt": "2026-08-29T17:35:49.445Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "While the Markets in Crypto-Assets regulation has successfully provided regulatory certainty for Europe's digital asset sector, experts argue it may have reduced market competition. Critics suggest the new framework creates a heavily concentrated environment, potentially driving smaller digital asset firms and startups to seek more favorable markets outside of Europe.",
